From a714fa39a643859d7de16f328e7d4339bdc42db5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Orca Glass <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:12:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(appearance): desktop wallpaper material, glass
 editor, one-step setup

Adds a Desktop wallpaper window material on Windows 11 (DWM Mica Alt): it
shows only the wallpaper and is sampled once, so it costs less than live
acrylic. Code editors now sit on the glass instead of painting an opaque
fill. Turning on Glass interface supplies a backdrop when none is set
(wallpaper first) and a 0.6 Background opacity when terminals are opaque,
and shows the restart prompt in its own row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
